hello and welcome to the Yale 2020  website i'm kimberly gulf cruz secretary  and vice president for university life  although traditional commencement  ceremonies will have to wait until we  can meet in person we couldn't let this  time pass without celebrating all  members of the Yale University class of  2020 as you explore this site you'll  find content from the University and  from your schools we hope it will help  you reflect on your experience at Yale  and all you have accomplished will  continue to add content throughout the  week and after May 18th and will keep  the site live for several months we'd  really love to add your photos and your  videos you can contribute by using the  links on the website or hashtag Yale  2020 on social media on Monday May 18th  beginning at 11 a.m. Eastern Standard  Time President salivates addressed to  the students and the official conferral  of student and honorary degrees will be  live chaplain Kugler will also share a  blessing and many schools will follow  with their own programming we hope you  enjoy the site and on behalf of all of  us at Yale warm congratulations to our  graduates and their proud families and  friends
 

